{
  "name": "Enrich Naver Place & Map Scraper leads with OpenAI and draft outreach in Gmail, Sheets, and Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Naver Place & Map Scraper — AI Co-Pilot & Multi-App Pipeline\n\nExtracts fresh data on a schedule with the **[naver-place-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/naver-place-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.0014 / item), skips seen records, logs all rows to **Google Sheets** and **CSV**, and enriches top matches with **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** for **Slack** and **Gmail**.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every 6 Hours** loads rules from **1. Configure Search & Rules**.\n2. **2. Run UnitBytes (naver-place-scraper)** fetches data and **3. Skip Seen Records** deduplicates by `placeId`.\n3. **4. Clean & Score Items** and **5. Map Export Fields** normalize `placeId, name, category, phone` and compute `priorityScore`.\n4. **6a. Log to Google Sheets** and **6b. Export Backup CSV** save all rows, while **6c. Filter High-Priority Items** routes top matches to **7. AI B2B SDR Cold Email Personalizer**.\n5. **8. Merge AI SDR Outreach Fields** merges AI fields and triggers **9a. Alert Sales Channel in Slack** and **9b. Create Personalized Gmail Draft**.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your token from [naver-place-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/naver-place-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) to the **HTTP Header Auth** credential on node 2.\n2. Edit `actorInput`, `sheetTab`, and `minLeadScore` in node 1.\n3. Connect **OpenAI**, **Google Sheets**, **Slack**, and **Gmail** credentials.\n\n### Customization\n- Adjust `minLeadScore` in node 1 or the prompt in node 7.\n- Docs: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/naver-place-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/naver-place-scraper/)",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
